#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "84_Sedentary Businessman"
msgid "What do you say we grab some post-workout yakiniku?\\r\nI hear the salted beef tongue here is to die for."
msgstr "¿Qué te parece si después de entrenar vamos por un Yakiniku? Escuché que la lengua salteada es de lo mejor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Sporty Businesswoman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "96_Sporty Businesswoman"
msgid "And cancel out all the calories I just burned? Yeah right!"
msgstr "¿Y recuperar todas las calorías que acabo de quemar? ¡Sí, ajá!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "108_Sedentary Businessman"
msgid "Don't worry, cooking on a grill melts off the extra fat.\\r\nAll that's left is pure protein!"
msgstr "Nah, no te preocupes, al hacerlo en parrillas se elimina\nla grasa extra, quedando solo la proteína."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "120_Sedentary Businessman"
msgid "Can't you smell that barbecue wafting through the air?\\r\nWho could possibly resist?"
msgstr "¿No percibes el olor a parrilla en el aire?\n¿Cómo te puedes resistir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Sporty Businesswoman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "132_Sporty Businesswoman"
msgid "Hrm. Well... *stomach growls*"
msgstr "Ehhh, pues... *estómago gruñendo*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
msgctxt "144_Sedentary Businessman"
msgid "We'll be fine if we don't overeat. So what do you say?\\r\nLet's go get us some yakiniku!"
msgstr "No pasará nada si no comemos mucho. Entonces,\n¿vamos por yakiniku?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=4
msgctxt "156_Saejima"
msgid "(After a quarter century in the slammer, yakiniku sounds mighty fine. That, and a cold beer to wash it down with.)"
msgstr "(Me merezco un buen yakiniku después de tanto tiempo en la carcel. Sí y una cerveza también)."
